# Uldaros Theorix and a split card (CR 709.3, 709.3a): only the half chosen is evaluated to be cast, so a copy of Life // Death
# is castable with 1 of the six left although the card in exile is worth 3 - and only Life (1) fits, not Death (2), so no
# half is asked for. Bot1 exiles Jace (4), Tarfire (1) and Life // Death and casts Jace and Tarfire first, leaving 1: the
# Life copy is cast at once (the refusal, with the neighbouring scenario, where both halves fit and Bot1 is asked, as the positive
# control). Life makes Bot1's lands 1/1 creatures until end of turn.

